{"h":3396,"w":2400,"lines":[{"c":1,"t":"Test 1","h":0.014567411690072807,"w":0.059670778910318911,"y":0.033430232401569171,"x":0.84567901373781529},{"t":"TOM:","c":1,"x":0.069958848648812244,"h":0.0087209298276508251,"y":0.082848837302744394,"w":0.037037035624186199},{"w":0.043600460688273113,"x":0.065648329665937949,"h":0.013738801819135227,"t":"JESS:","y":0.097055017536715082,"c":1},{"t":"TOM:","x":0.069958848340170257,"y":0.11482558129275489,"w":0.037037035624186199,"h":0.008720930389296444,"c":1},{"t":"JESS:","w":0.045267489751180029,"x":0.065843621551021775,"y":0.14389534863581788,"h":0.011627907185728592,"c":1},{"h":0.011627907185728703,"c":1,"t":"TOM:","w":0.039094648361206047,"y":0.19040697652341476,"x":0.067901235634211785},{"y":0.22674418578550726,"w":0.037037035624186199,"h":0.010174418787512574,"c":1,"t":"TOM:","x":0.069958848785986447},{"y":0.30523255801984195,"t":"JESS:","w":0.043209877014160153,"x":0.067901234246692213,"h":0.010174418787512463,"c":1},{"c":1,"t":"TOM:","w":0.039874893824259447,"y":0.32024756413902611,"x":0.067537224275111676,"h":0.011184130737160847},{"w":0.043209877014160153,"x":0.067901234615347902,"y":0.33430232586196984,"h":0.013081394460653484,"t":"JESS:","c":1},{"w":0.037037035624186199,"h":0.008720930389296444,"c":1,"t":"TOM:","y":0.3822674417578712,"x":0.069958848340170257},{"y":0.39495948340781162,"h":0.012406614278876349,"c":1,"t":"JESS:","x":0.067697334272760631,"w":0.04361767768859863},{"c":1,"w":0.039288206100463866,"y":0.41117292545477147,"t":"TOM:","h":0.011956474385076188,"x":0.067804456854469189},{"x":0.067901234486747064,"h":0.011627907185728592,"c":1,"t":"JESS:","y":0.42732558119395736,"w":0.043209877014160153},{"h":0.011956474385076188,"y":0.45768455336174818,"w":0.039288206100463866,"t":"TOM:","x":0.067804456854469189,"c":1},{"x":0.06790123466678824,"t":"JESS:","y":0.47238372121080707,"h":0.013081394460653373,"c":1,"w":0.043209877014160153},{"w":0.039094648361206061,"x":0.067901235430165144,"y":0.50436046496333731,"t":"TOM:","c":1,"h":0.011627907185728592},{"c":1,"y":0.51889534858884168,"h":0.013081395583944611,"x":0.06790123455876354,"t":"JESS:","w":0.043209877014160167},{"t":"TOM:","h":0.011627907185728592,"c":1,"x":0.067901233791410984,"w":0.039094651540120443,"y":0.53488372078940316},{"y":0.59593023233736819,"w":0.043209877014160167,"h":0.011627907185728703,"x":0.06790123455876354,"t":"JESS:","c":1},{"t":"TOM:","c":1,"h":0.008720930389296444,"w":0.037037035624186199,"x":0.069958848346222069,"y":0.65843023245412047},{"w":0.043209877014160153,"t":"JESS:","h":0.013081394460653373,"x":0.06790123466678824,"y":0.68750000028057445,"c":1},{"y":0.081395348711183924,"t":"What?","h":0.011627907185728592,"c":1,"w":0.055555553436279298,"x":0.16460905445469987},{"y":0.095930232432200224,"w":0.21604937235514321,"h":0.013081395583944722,"c":1,"t":"You know, give a rationale.","x":0.16666667171126454},{"y":0.11189634874747711,"h":0.014557139752750858,"c":1,"w":0.62345677693684898,"t":"I didn't realise we had to do that. OK, I can add it now. And I've done the video","x":0.16460905998485431},{"c":1,"w":0.63168726603190106,"t":"diary presentation, and worked out what I want my outcome to be in the project.","x":0.16666665504922065,"y":0.12632508819127086,"h":0.013250883392226132},{"t":"Someone told me it's best not to be too precise about your actual outcome at this Q23\/Q24","x":0.16661476574767145,"h":0.015671971549134023,"c":1,"w":0.7264513651529948,"y":0.14082789357340042},{"w":0.64825302124023443,"t":"stage, so you have more scope to explore your ideas later on. So I'm going to go","h":0.016805516816982835,"x":0.16454789431615835,"y":0.15629404736985741,"c":1},{"c":1,"x":0.16666666653975559,"y":0.17285041236365184,"h":0.013250883392226243,"w":0.39094650268554687,"t":"back to my proposal to make it a bit more vague."},{"x":0.16666666404160235,"c":1,"w":0.29423868815104165,"y":0.18895348823580005,"t":"Really? OK, III change that too then.","h":0.01453488398216074},{"t":"One part of the project I'm unsure about is where we choose some paintings","h":0.013250883392226132,"w":0.60493825276692703,"y":0.22526501743040106,"c":1,"x":0.16872428914710669},{"y":0.23936939736921836,"c":1,"h":0.01756552167157821,"t":"of birds and say what they mean to us. Like, I chose a painting of a falcon by","x":0.16454466972941029,"w":0.6133109029134115},{"t":"Landseer. I like it because the bird's standing there with his head turned to one","w":0.62757202148437508,"h":0.014534883982160851,"c":1,"x":0.16460905094417702,"y":0.25581395335332546},{"y":0.27031802105380487,"x":0.16460907797399443,"w":0.65226333618164056,"c":1,"h":0.016019187630697207,"t":"side, but he seems to be staring straight at you. But I can't just say it's a bit scary,"},{"w":0.051440327962239601,"c":1,"h":0.010306242638397967,"y":0.28769140138348992,"t":"can I?","x":0.16666666737461866},{"t":"You could talk about the possible danger suggested by the bird's look.","y":0.30083344869092521,"c":1,"x":0.16454649052163434,"h":0.017198591265998431,"w":0.5577444458007812},{"y":0.31831395333269674,"w":0.067901236216227179,"t":"Oh, OK.","h":0.01453488398216074,"x":0.16666666573252781,"c":1},{"h":0.016195524146054296,"w":0.62551442464192708,"x":0.16666665589416974,"c":1,"t":"There's a picture of a fish hawk by Audubon I like. It's swooping over the water","y":0.33274440523189619},{"c":1,"x":0.16455251852684161,"t":"with a fish in its talons, and with great black wings which take up most of the","w":0.60917399088541668,"h":0.017534350337914839,"y":0.3472737664918335},{"t":"picture.","h":0.015340609601024235,"y":0.36436583338998396,"w":0.065025170644124358,"c":1,"x":0.16609146105393208},{"y":0.37709586245272608,"t":"So you could discuss it in relation to predators and food chains?","h":0.017002112452638496,"x":0.16654487036236726,"w":0.51054092407226559,"c":1},{"h":0.01453488398216074,"w":0.61522633870442711,"y":0.39389534869663867,"x":0.16666666621207982,"c":1,"t":"Well actually I think I'Il concentrate on the impression of rapid motion it gives."},{"t":"Q25","c":1,"x":0.83950617344305101,"w":0.037037035624186254,"y":0.30087209286482264,"h":0.013081395583944722},{"y":0.39389534868118092,"h":0.013081395583944611,"t":"Q26","w":0.037037035624186254,"x":0.83950617344910272,"c":1},{"h":0.016792446761024538,"c":1,"x":0.16660558347929813,"y":0.42372167994678223,"w":0.61947718302408861,"t":"Do you know that picture of a kingfisher by van Gogh - it's perching on a reed"},{"t":"growing near a stream.","x":0.16872427870222567,"w":0.18724280039469399,"h":0.011627907185728703,"y":0.44186046500060616,"c":1},{"x":0.16872426810945759,"h":0.013081395583944611,"t":"Yes it's got these beautiful blue and red and black shades.","w":0.46502059936523432,"c":1,"y":0.45639534871658483},{"t":"Mm hm. I've actually chosen it because I saw a real kingfisher once when I was","y":0.47084805636446381,"w":0.63374486287434895,"h":0.014723203769140158,"c":1,"x":0.16666666311658068},{"x":0.83950617345591094,"t":"Q27","h":0.011627907185728592,"c":1,"w":0.037037035624186143,"y":0.47093023241731014},{"w":0.55967076619466138,"h":0.014553715960858749,"c":1,"x":0.16666667442074518,"t":"little, I was out walking with my grandfather, and I've never forgotten it.","y":0.48691860451765212},{"w":0.248971201578776,"t":"So we can use a personal link?","h":0.011627907185728592,"c":1,"x":0.16872427565179854,"y":0.50290697663484885},{"x":0.16564986791709937,"t":"Sure.","w":0.049486799240112289,"h":0.015615198160088384,"c":1,"y":0.51690453081369481},{"w":0.62757202148437508,"t":"OK. There's a portrait called William Wells, I can't remember the artist but it's a","y":0.53197674404961726,"c":1,"x":0.16666666417880019,"h":0.014548579711374909},{"x":0.16666665694324745,"w":0.6193415832519531,"t":"middle-aged man who's just shot a bird. And his expression, and the way he's","y":0.54796511614326349,"c":1,"h":0.01453488398216074},{"y":0.56107428039580554,"h":0.018573040956602727,"x":0.16656209086834281,"t":"holding the bird in his hand suggests he's not sure about what he's done. To me","w":0.63600916544596353,"c":1},{"w":0.62139918009440109,"t":"it's about how ambiguous people are in the way they exploit the natural world.","h":0.014562276002234587,"x":0.16666666825183929,"y":0.57848837188165869,"c":1},{"t":"Q28","y":0.57848837195433134,"w":0.037037035624186254,"x":0.83950617344910272,"h":0.011627907185728592,"c":1},{"w":0.63168726603190106,"t":"Interesting. There's Gauguin's picture Vairumati. He did it in Tahiti. It's a woman","h":0.01453488398216074,"x":0.16666665494052835,"c":1,"y":0.59447674405237771},{"x":0.16666667328779888,"c":1,"h":0.014723203769140158,"y":0.6089517080424186,"t":"with a white bird behind her that is eating a lizard, and what I'm interested in is","w":0.62345677693684887},{"t":"what idea this bird refers to. Apparently, it's a reference to the never-ending cycle","x":0.16666666122080984,"c":1,"h":0.014575971731448756,"y":0.6249999998665895,"w":0.6460905456542968},{"h":0.011627907185728592,"w":0.037037035624186254,"y":0.62499999986130794,"x":0.83950617344910272,"t":"Q29","c":1},{"t":"of existence.","y":0.64098837186645796,"w":0.10493827184041341,"x":0.16666666581161774,"h":0.013081395583944722,"c":1},{"t":"Wow. I chose a portrait of a little boy, Giovanni de Medici. He's holding a tiny bird","y":0.65402653144626655,"x":0.16661226988350525,"c":1,"w":0.65030059814453134,"h":0.017456172633086853},{"c":1,"y":0.65406976726582366,"t":"Q30","x":0.82304526850433968,"h":0.014534883982160851,"w":0.055555553436279492},{"h":0.016043156420524673,"t":"in one fist. I like the way he's holding it carefully so he doesn't hurt it.","x":0.16460905402143661,"y":0.67005813938817882,"w":0.55144032796223952,"c":1},{"t":"Ah right.","c":1,"x":0.16662503191136727,"y":0.68738467322553709,"w":0.07209973017374674,"h":0.013312048850267266},{"y":0.73387757289625366,"w":0.10913880666097005,"h":0.017709970193420355,"c":1,"t":"PART 4","x":0.069916192880796799},{"y":0.76295641949029969,"t":"Ancient philosophy is not just about talking or lecturing, or even reading long, dense books.","w":0.72839508056640623,"x":0.069958838518539707,"h":0.016195524146054185,"c":1},{"w":0.7285925292968749,"h":0.019533874008484275,"c":1,"y":0.77748775656414659,"t":"In fact, it is something people have used throughout history - to solve their problems and to","x":0.06987385260133322},{"t":"achieve their greatest triumphs.","w":0.25514404296875004,"x":0.072016455831185336,"y":0.79505300372001253,"h":0.013086531271782831,"c":1},{"c":1,"x":0.069958835878348863,"y":0.8168433448692054,"h":0.017458980861344786,"w":0.68930043538411456,"t":"Specifically, I am referring to Stoicism, which, in my opinion, is the most practical of all"},{"y":0.83274440522958892,"w":0.72839508056640623,"c":1,"t":"philosophies and therefore the most appealing. Stoicism was founded in Ancient Greece by","x":0.06995883834317207,"h":0.016195524146054185},{"w":0.73662551879882809,"y":0.84738372076369539,"t":"Zeno of Citium in the early 3rd century BC, but was practised by the likes of Epictetus, Cato,","x":0.069958845707628073,"c":1,"h":0.017457268403753057},{"x":0.84156378667350362,"h":0.01453488398216074,"y":0.81540697654089633,"w":0.037037035624186143,"c":1,"t":"Q31"},{"c":1,"h":0.014534883982160851,"y":0.90406976726582366,"w":0.037037035624186143,"x":0.87242798414263956,"t":"101"},{"h":0.028373837330596841,"c":1,"t":"IELTSXpress.com","x":0.71947458444650803,"y":0.9542207520207302,"w":0.25443445841471357}]}